Read RawPedia here: <a href="http://rawpedia.rawtherapee.com/" title="RawPedia">rawpedia.rawtherapee.com</a></p></div>

<div>Developing raw images is a breeze when you know what it is you want to achieve, and
    when you know the tools you have at your disposal. The RawPedia wiki contains
    articles which describe every tool and topic related to RawTherapee, and more.
    Reading it will answer most of your questions, it will give you greater power and
    maneuverability in getting the most out of RawTherapee's tools, and it will save you
    time!
